<KrFinancePage slug="annual-leave-promotion-planner" locale="ko" title={title} description={description} shell={ko} faqs={faqs} koOnly>
  <LeavePromotion client:load />
  <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground">근거: 근로기준법 제60조·제61조, 시행령 별표 1. 기준일 {WELFARE_AS_OF}. <a class="underline" href="/ko/benefit-rights-toolkit/">생활 지원금·노동권 도구 모음</a> · <a class="underline" href="/ko/labor-law-guide/">노동법 길잡이</a></p>
